.TH P4KX 1 "" "P4KX" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
p4kx \- browse, extract and convert Star Citizen Archives
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B p4kx
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I COMMAND
.RI [ ARGUMENTS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
P4KX reads local Star Citizen Archives and exports their Entries.
It includes format conversion and structured data exports.
It contains no game files or Archive key.
.SH OPTIONS
.B p4kx --help
lists the available commands and global options.
.B p4kx help COMMAND
describes a command and its options.
.SH FILES
Settings and the stored Archive key are in the P4KX directory below
XDG_CONFIG_HOME, or ~/.config when that variable is absent.
P4KX_FOLDERS_ROOT selects an absolute isolated root for config, cache and data.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR p4kx-gui (1),
.BR p4kx-mcp (1)
.PP
https://github.com/p4kx-org/p4kx/blob/main/docs/commands.md
